<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Oil service stocks initiated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Oil service stocks initiated.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co analyst Allen Brooks initiated coverage of oil service and related stocks, according to a market source.</p>
<p>-- initiated Camco International Inc, Datum Inc, Cooper Cameron Corp, and Hvide Marine Corp as buy.</p>
<p>-- started Baker Hughes Inc, Tidewater Inc, Nabors Industries Inc, and Smith International Inc as outperform.</p>
</text>
